ed the features from a giant dataset of 1.2 million images called ImageNet. There are different types of CNNs that have different structures (architectures) that work better or worse depending on your criteria. With this project you'll explore the three different architectures (AlexNet, VGG, and ResNet).","topics":[],"score":250576,"global_rank":60618},{"name":"jpyces/Car-Game-in-Python","owner":"jpyces","html_url":"https://github.com/jpyces/Car-Game-in-Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":250575,"global_rank":60632},{"name":"dijkstracula/higherorderpython","owner":"dijkstracula","html_url":"https://github.com/dijkstracula/higherorderpython","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Higher Order Perl but in Python","topics":[],"score":250575,"global_rank":60633},{"name":"rocket3989/ieeextreme14","owner":"rocket3989","html_url":"https://github.com/rocket3989/ieeextreme14","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"CUC Bat Knights' Solutions for ieeextreme 14","topics":[],"score":250571,"global_rank":60640}]